     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Each tense in its place",
     "texto": [
      "For what happened and is over: **Fui ao Porto** (I went to Porto). To describe how everything was: **Estava sol e as ruas estavam cheias** (it was sunny and the streets were full). For something already done before: **Quando cheguei, já tinha almoçado** (when I arrived, I had already had lunch)."
     ],
